cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EM Virtual Lab: an interactive MATLAB laboratory for plane-wave reflection and transmission at a media boundary"
abstract: >-
  A toolbox-free MATLAB GUI that visualises electromagnetic plane-wave
  interaction with a planar boundary: TE/TM Fresnel coefficients, Brewster and
  critical angles, total internal reflection and the evanescent field, standing
  waves on a perfect conductor, and lossy or magnetic media. Every displayed
  quantity is verified against closed-form theory.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-19"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mmd-kad/em-virtual-lab"
keywords:
  - electromagnetics
  - Fresnel equations
  - plane wave reflection
  - total internal reflection
  - standing wave
  - MATLAB GUI
  - physics education
